  "description": "The Grave of Swords is no easy place to enter. The weapons there remain stuck in the ground, impossible to take out and use. That is, unless the wielder is worthy. But is Chan-Ui really worthy? He’s merely an errand boy; he’s not fit for greatness. He’ll never amount too much. However, fate seems to have a different plan for this lowly boy...\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes 1 extra chapter.*",
